  "question": "Where can I find a gallery that fall within 60 kilometers in the south direction of Stratton Fire Tower, Stratton, Vermont?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.924966 43.086214)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.924966 43.086214)',4326)::geography, 60000)\nAND tourism = 'gallery'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 157.5 AND 202.5;\n",
